                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very nice game. Good variety of levels and enemies with increasing difficulty/complexity. The boss level is challenging but fun. Fortix 2 includes all Fortix 1 levels as an unlockable bonus, which is very nice. It would be better if unlocked areas were traversible rather than just the available line, but I see how this would break some gameplay scenarios so it's fine I guess. The developers did well on this one.",
